- **D2 (stale model badge)** + **D3 (double storyboard)** (`dd8f727`) — D2: GET now applies the provider override + panel re-fetches label each turn. D3: `hasActiveJob` (since-free QUEUED/RUNNING guard) on all 3 SB-fire sites — «no re-fire if agent running» (Director's words). Verify: tsc·0 / vitest 1206 (+8) / replay 30.
- **D5 (THE big one — Mode-3 auto-advance NESTING_STEPS)** (`87caecf`) — `factory.ts isPlanCritic` called `step.sendEvent` INSIDE a `step.run` → Inngest rejects (NESTING_STEPS, **72× in the E27 prod log**) → Plan flipped APPROVED but the Artist/VGEN event was SILENTLY DROPPED → 26 Mode-3 Plans APPROVED, 0 images. Fix: step.run RETURNS the events; sendEvent moved to function top level. Verify: tsc·0 / vitest 1206 / replay 30.
- **Cap raise** (`4a36498`) — `exec-eref-designer` concurrency 3→5 (the designer cap, not the critic cap 5, was the fanout ceiling). Director OK'd.
- **Zombie cleanup** — 33 orphaned RUNNING/QUEUED job rows (up to 68 days old, 0 younger than 12 min) marked FAILED. Correct column is `error_message`, not `error`.
- **E27 format fix (DATA, no deploy)** — `episodes.metadata.generation_config.video.aspect_ratio` 9:16→16:9 for SS-S15-E27. Now aspect(16:9)==delivery(landscape fallback 16:9) → V06 will PASS; E27 = coherent 16:9 landscape master. Verified BEFORE/AFTER via script; other metadata preserved.
