## What Did NOT Work (and why) — do NOT retry

- **My first Mode-3 «fix»** (extend critic-PASS auto-advance from AUTOTEST to Mode 3 in `next-events.ts`) — DISCARDED: the code-review subagent flagged it (a) REDUNDANT — `factory.ts:788 isPlanCritic` already targets Mode 2/3, and (b) BUGGY — missing the `demoteSiblingApproved` sibling-demote (would crash on the 0036 unique index). Reverted cleanly. The REAL bug was that the existing mechanism was broken at runtime (NESTING_STEPS), which only the SERVER LOG revealed — not the code-read. **Lesson banked as a global rule.**
- **Changing ref image format to 9:16 for shorts** — ABANDONED (Director): gpt-image-2 (current ref provider) CANNOT do true 9:16 (portrait max 1024×1536 = 2:3; true 9:16 `1536×2752` is gemini/image-gen-multi only). Director: keep refs LANDSCAPE — a reusable master for both cropped-shorts and normal video.
- **`error` column on jobs** — wrong; the column is `error_message`. First zombie-kill updated 0 rows silently.
- **`jq` / MCP execute_sql** — not available; use local tsx + `@supabase/supabase-js`.

