- **D6 — critic throughput + tail-hang.** Diagnosed (`docs/analysis/E27-run-defects.md` D6): the slow crawl is orchestration overhead (~18 inngest→app round-trips/shot + `loadAgentInputs` loaded TWICE per run), not the LLM; the tail-HANG (SH25/SH27 ~10 min) is the provider-fetch-no-timeout stall riding to `finishTimeout:10m`. Fixes: finish the `fetchWithTimeout` swap on the critic provider call; de-dup the double `loadAgentInputs`; collapse cheap steps. Separate PR, deploy in a quiet window.
- **Format recurrence code-fix** (plan `~/.claude/plans/twinkling-booping-yeti.md`): consolidate the DRY-duplicated delivery-target resolvers (`resolveAnimatorDeliveryTargets` animator.ts:605 ≡ `resolveDeliveryTargets` episode-reference-designer.ts:314) into ONE aspect-aware resolver + reverse helper `canonicalTargetForAspect` — so a 9:16 episode can never carry a landscape target. (Root: `delivery_targets` has NO write path → always falls back to hardcoded youtube_landscape.)
