## Decisions Made

- **Reconciler OFF for the real-distribution smoke** (q3) — manual gates, per reconciler audit.
- **Keep reference images LANDSCAPE** — gpt-image-2 can't do true 9:16; landscape = reusable master for shorts+normal. E27 aligned to full 16:9 (option A) to stop V06.
- **NO deploy / server restart during a live run** — push+merge OK, deploy only with Director OK + zero running processes (NEW RULE — I broke this mid-session by restarting during E27's fanout → connection-refused stalls). Memory `no_deploy_during_live_run`.
- **ALWAYS overlay agent reports on server logs** — runtime beats static (NEW GLOBAL RULE). The reviewer said isPlanCritic «works»; the prod log showed NESTING_STEPS.
- **Recovery by Тео batch, not Polina** — Polina would skew the run statistics because the code was broken all run.

